      "situation": "Running Dijkstra from \\(S\\) with \\(w(S, X) = 2\\), \\(w(S, Y) = 3\\) and \\(w(Y, X) = -2\\).",
      "wrong": "Settle \\(X\\) at 2 and keep it.",
      "right": "The path through \\(Y\\) costs \\(3 + (-2) = 1\\).",
      "why": "\\(X\\) was settled before \\(Y\\); the negative edge undercuts a value that is already final."
    },
